 ## Gates (Part A): where the model earns a say
 
 Segments = encounters (backed off to act x kind, then kind, then global, below 120 decision points in pairs). Advantage = concordance of the blend w_cap x model + (1 - w_cap) x current minus the current weights' (w_cap on [0.25, 0.5, 0.75, 1.0], the one with the highest lower bound); w = w_cap x n/(n+100) x smoothstep(CI low / 0.02). 400 cluster-bootstrap resamples of the similar-state groups, 90% CI. Written to src/knowledge/fight-value-gates.json.
 
